Failure to fully utilize the available resources is a major cause of poverty.

We firmly believe that the current status of ayurveda and ayurveda doctors could have been far better if ayurveda doctors had fully used all the actions and uses of the available drugs for treating various diseases.

Here, we are going to share our lifetime experiences related to the optimal use of five important ayurvedic drugs. Know about them and make full use of these drugs in your clinical practice.

*1. Jatiphal (जातीफल)* 
Jatiphal is useful in diarrhea. That's true. But, it is quite useful in relieving pain, too. So, we used it to manage various types of pain, like - 
• Tooth pain (दन्त-शूल);
• Joint pain (सन्धि-शूल);
• Back pain (कटि-शूल);
• Period pain (कष्टार्तव);
• Herpes zoster (कक्षा);
• Neuralgic pain (नाडी-शूल);
• Sciatica (गृध्रसी); 
• Lumbar spondylitis (कटि-वात);
• Cervical spondylitis (ग्रीवा-वात).

_We use Jatiphal as - Jatiphal churna, Jatiphaladi churna, Jatiphaladi vati, Jatiphal ark, Jatiphal ghan vati (tab), Dolid tab, Loswel tab, DeAlco tab, etc._

*2. Shati (शटी)* 
Shati is useful in cough. That's true. But we found it quite useful in three more diseases - 
• Allergic disorders (असात्म्यता-जन्य रोग);
• Acid peptic diseases (अम्लपित्त). 
• Vomiting (छर्दि / उल्टी).

_We use Shati as - Shati churna, Shatyadi churna, Shati kvath, Shati ghan vati (tab), Chhardi-ripu tab, Lergex, Locid tab, etc._

*3. Dugdhika (दुग्धिका)* 
Dugdhika is useful in asthma. That's why it is called Asthma drug. But we found Dugdhika quite effective in three other diseases, too - 
• Osteo-arthritis (सन्धिवात);
• Viral infections (विषाणु-जन्य संक्रमण);
• Piles / Hemorrhoids (अर्श-रोग / बवासीर).

_We use Dugdhika as - Dugdhika churna, Dugdhika kvath, Cartogen tab, Antivir tab, Pilie tab, etc._

*4. Madhuyashti (मधुयष्टी)* 
Madhuyashti is widely used for managing cough, due to its demulscent activity. However, we found Madhuyashti useful in - 
• Acid Peptic Diseases (अम्लपित्त);
• Auto-immune disorders (आमविषज रोग), like - ulcerative colitis, psoriasis, etc.
• Inflammatory diseases (शोथ-युक्त रोग), like - arthritis, asthma, etc.

_We use Madhuyashti as - Madhuyashti churna, Yashtyadi churna, Madhuyashti kvath, Madhuyashti ghan vati (tab), Locid tab, Lergex tab, etc._

*5. Madanphal (मदनफल)* 
Madanphal is widely used for inducing Vomiting in Panch-karma. However, we found it quite useful in other diseases, too - 
• Auto-immune Disorders (आमविषज रोग);
• Allergic disorders (असात्म्यता-जन्य);
• Oligo-menorhea (अल्पार्तव).

_We use Madanphal as - Madanphal churna, Madanphal ghan vati (tab), etc._

*Conclusion (निष्कर्ष)*
• Along with treating diarrhea, Jatiphal also relieves pain.
• In addition to relieving cough, Shati is effective in allergies, acid peptic diseases, and vomiting.
• Along with asthma, Dugdhika is useful in osteoarthritis, viral infections, and hemorrhoids.
• In addition to relieving cough, Madhuyashti is effective in acid peptic diseases, autoimmune disorders, and inflammatory diseases.
• Along with inducing vomiting, Madanphal is beneficial in autoimmune disorders, allergic disorders, and oligo-menorrhea.

