• Acidity - Shati+Madhuyashti

These medicines can be used in the form of Single-drug churna, Single-drug ghan tabs, or as Multi-drug formulations prepared from them.

*What are the major uses of Gandhak?*
Gandhak can be useful in - 
• Hair disorders;
• Pimples;
• Urinary tract infection;
• Leucorrhoea (श्वेतप्रदर);
• Pelvic inflammatory disease;
• Tumors;
• Cysts;
• Immune Deficiency;
• Liver Disorders

*What do you understand by auto-immunity?*
When the immune system becomes distorted and damages the body's own organs and tissues, causing disease, it is called auto-immunity.

*What is auto-immunity called in Ayurveda?*
In Ayurveda, auto-immunity can be referred to as Ojasvyapat

*What are the main auto-immune diseases?*
Major auto-immune diseases include - 
• Rheumatoid Arthritis;
• Ankylosing spondylitis;
• Psoriasis;
• Ulcerative Colitis;
• Hashimoto’s Thyroiditis;
• Alopecia Areata;
• Vitiligo;
• Lupus; etc.

*Which drugs are useful in auto-immune diseases?*
Effective medicines for auto-immune diseases include - 
• Bhallatak;
• Ashwagandha
• Madhuyashti
• Guduchi
• Tulasi, etc.

*Which diseases do you use Bhallatak for?*
We use Bhallatak in - 
• Auto-immune disorders;
• Hypothyroidism.
• Tumors;
• PCOD;
• Bacterial infections;
• Viral infections;
• Fungal infections;
• Coronary artery disease;
• Inflammatory diseases.
