• Parsika-yavani (पारसीक-यवानी);
• Shankhpushpi (शंखपुष्पी);
• Brahmi (ब्राह्मी);
• Ashwagandha (अश्वगन्धा), etc.

These drugs can be used as churna, Single-drug ghan tablets, or Multi-Drug formulations such as - Ashwagandha Pak, DeAlco tablet, Jatiphaladi Churna/Vati, Stresyl tablet, Parsik-Yavani Ark, etc.

