Men who excessively consume alcohol, smoke, or use drugs often complain of weakness.

This kind of weakness can be addressed as follows -
*1. Tonic (रसायन) Drugs* - Use the following tonic drugs -
Amalaki, Lakshmana, Shilajit, Shaival, Shigru, Mukta-shukti, Abhrak, Gandhak, Yashad, etc. These drugs can be used as churna, Single-drug ghan tablets, or Multi-Drug formulations such as - Amlaki Rasayan, Shilajatvadi Vati, Minovit tablet, etc.
*2. De-addiction Treatment* -
Use drugs like Jatiphal, Tagar, Parsika-yavani, Sahadevi, etc. These drugs can be used as churna, Single-drug ghan tablets, or Multi-Drug formulations such as - Jatiphaladi Churna, DeAlco tablet, etc. Sahadevi is especially useful for smoking cessation.

*Nutritional Deficiencies*
Nowadays, many men experience weakness due to deficiencies in essential nutrients, such as -
*1. Iron Deficiency* – Use Lauh Bhasma, Mandura Bhasma, Swarnamakshik Bhasma, etc.
*2. Calcium & Vitamin D Deficiency* – Use Kakmachi, Amalaki, Mukta-shukti Bhasma, Mukta Pishti, Praval Bhasma, Ossie tablet, Livie tablet, etc.
*3. Vitamin B12 Deficiency* - Use Shilajit, Minovit tablet. Advise in diet - meat, fish, egg, cow milk, etc.
*4. Protein Deficiency* - Advise intake of milk, paneer, yogurt, pulses, dry fruit, meat, fish, egg, mushrooms, algae, Shigru, etc.

*Chronic Diseases*
Long-standing diseases can also cause fatigue and weakness, such as:
• Obesity (मोटपा/स्थौल्य);
• Diabetes (मधुमेह);
• Heart diseases - CAD (हृदय-रोग);
• Kidney failure (वृक्क-अक्षमता);
• Liver disorders (यकृत्-रोग);
• Cancer (कैंसर);
• AIDS (एड्स), etc.

*Chronic Fatigue Syndrome & Fibromyalgia*
Men suffering from these two conditions often report persistent fatigue. You may use the following types of medications -
*1. Immuno-modulator (आमविषहर) drugs* 
Bhallatak, Ashwagandha, Madhuyashti, Guduchi, Tulasi, Pippali, Suvarna, etc., as Single Drugs, or Multi-Drug Formulations like Amrit-Bhallatak, Ashwagandha Pak, Imunie tablet, Imunie Gold tablet, Revplaq tablet, etc.
*2. Antidepressant (मनःबल्य) drugs*
Jyotishmati, Kapikacchu, Gandira, Vacha, Suvarna, etc., as Single Drugs, or Multi-Drug Formulations, such as - Jyotishmati Rasayan, Kaunch Pak, Eleva tablet, etc.
*3. Anti-inflammatory (शोथहर) Drugs*
Shallaki, Guggulu, Erandamula, Nirgundi, Bilva-patra, Rasna, etc., as Single Drugs, or Multi-Drug Formulations, like - Panchatikta-ghrit Guggulu, Loswel tablet, Revplaq tab, etc.

*Lack of Physical Activity*
Many men feel weak simply because they do little to no physical activity. If the patient history suggests this, advise daily exercise like walking, jogging, dancing, swimming, cycling, skipping, yoga, light weightlifting, etc.

*Conclusion:*
There are numerous conditions and disorders that can lead to weakness in men. Without treating these underlying issues, true recovery is not possible. This article sheds light on this crucial clinical subject.
